alse,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Xi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f14cb31-eda6-4392-8882-2c8600387cd0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`!= null` だと is null のassert対象？が動的に変わってるんじゃないですかね？","ts":"1633833462.413200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633833465.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aog"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be9e238b-26c8-48be-af71-0653630b0b3a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"いや \"null or undefined\" が否定されたら下とおなじになるな","ts":"1633833422.412400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0imk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71f3bb17-c6dc-4493-9fb4-c3127caf8d40","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`isNone(x)` が否定されても \"null or undefined\" が否定されただけで、\n`x != null` が否定されたら x は null でも undefined でもないことが確定するからでしょうかね","ts":"1633833387.411800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1633833390.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zZIK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f554f539-412b-4941-ba9e-a29d8cc7aae2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`x is null` だからだめで、 `!= null` の場合は `x.foobar is null` って動的に推論されてるのか","ts":"1633833360.411200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s0C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ed08359-ec44-4283-a388-e6d15b7073d2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"むしろなんで != null なら通るんだくらいの気持ちがある","ts":"1633833174.409900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iuX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b38e80c-8aad-4c4f-b1b1-326cdc7e5fc9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いつの間にか直りそうではあるけど・・・","ts":"1633833018.409500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y05UN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2bd4087-cfe8-4d29-b801-628cb802a869","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`x is null | undefined` 、めっちゃ使いづらい","ts":"1633833007.409200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2599d66-4768-4db6-8246-106e7ce311d6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```type Foo = {\n  bar?: {\n    foobar?: {\n      hoge: string;\n    };\n  };\n};```\nのとき\n```const foo = getFoo();\nif (foo.bar?.foobar?.hoge != null) {\n  console.log(foo.bar.foobar.hoge); // Success\n}```\nは通るけどisNoneは多重に書かないとダメ","ts":"1633832836.408200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633832861.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RtiBl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97523026-d50e-4339-a793-fd544bd34805","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何かに代入するくらいしか思い付かんな","ts":"1633832771.407600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wQk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"419daf76-6e90-4d18-a872-f09a70dbfcdb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Optional chainしてるのに絶対要素があるという状態をTSが表現できなさそう？","ts":"1633832761.407200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4dcc358-8e8d-43f7-a364-ab833cbb9d5a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"foobarがnullableなオブジェクトの場合\n`!isNone(foo.bar) \u0026amp;\u0026amp; !isNone(foo.bar.foobar) \u0026amp;\u0026amp; console.log(foo.bar.foobar.hoge)` 的な","ts":"1633832681.406100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mV2y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc5891d8-6209-4920-9ee6-bc5fcabf791c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"でもこれnullableな値がメソッドチェインで複数あったときに多分 `isNone` を複数回書く必要出ますよね\n確認してないですけど・・・","ts":"1633832587.404700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJa0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d09192f-7d7b-4f37-a147-3fa5bf032f0a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```{\n  const foo = getFoo();\n  if (!isNone(foo.bar)) {\n    console.log(foo.bar.foobar); // Success\n  }\n}```\nは問題ない","ts":"1633832547.403800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OhA57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b1a1686-f22d-409b-be66-c9e049524775","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんかそこで気を使ってコード書くの本末転倒感があるんですよね","ts":"1633832509.403500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SZyaI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c37055a-51e1-4aa7-806a-5d66fd20f55e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あーでもfalsyな値だと死ぬか","ts":"1633832490.403200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ub1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"beef9e0d-47a0-45a2-bb76-086660e9e209","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(試してない)","ts":"1633832471.402600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cL=w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"468fd877-9dbc-434e-80bb-c0f91d8f9f4d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`!isNone(foo.bar)` なら通るんだけどうーん・・・","ts":"1633832459.402300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633832474.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0Sk6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcb27139-5453-41d6-bc57-28a922842c17","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`?? false`とか？","ts":"1633832457.402200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/NHt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c545694c-a578-4870-9eab-0bb8bbabb050","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e 回避法もし分かれば・・・","ts":"1633832397.401500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GCnm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec85adc5-5488-4e28-b352-ab9df6ad8e5f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`!= null` の方が推論が強くなっちゃう","ts":"1633832363.401100","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633832425.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UyD7V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0370f03a-e75e-4a9d-889d-e91951256d4d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"unknownutil使っててこうなっちゃうんですけど、これって回避しようがないんですかねー\n```import { isNone } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/unknownutil/mod.ts\u003e\";\n\ntype Foo = {\n  bar?: {\n    foobar: string;\n  };\n};\n\nconst getFoo = (): Foo =\u0026gt; (\n  {\n    bar: {\n      foobar: \"foobar\",\n    },\n  }\n);\n\n{\n  const foo = getFoo();\n  if (!isNone(foo.bar?.foobar)) {\n    console.log(foo.bar.foobar); // Error: [deno-ts 2532] [E] Object is possibly 'undefined'.\n  }\n}\n\n{\n  const foo = getFoo();\n  if (foo.bar?.foobar != null) {\n    console.log(foo.bar.foobar); // Success\n  }\n}```","ts":"1633832318.400300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633832322.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+wh"}]}]
